		specs: "Weatherproof strand woven bamboo decking surrounding a private pond and sheltered pavilion, offering splinter-free comfort for barefoot walking.",
		location: "Waterfront Residential",
	},
	{
		img: port7,
		title: "Contemporary Lawn-Adjacent Residence Terrace",
		category: "Flat-Profile Strand Woven Decking",
